msgstr ""

#: ../../colophon.rst:25
#: e82ae0aec04844e3835349ed694c1627
msgid "Origins and development"
msgstr ""

#: ../../colophon.rst:27
#: 9bb79fa1a96941f1b82fd83ee9f6d470
msgid "You can find `an earlier presentation of some of these ideas <https://documentation.divio.com>`_, that I created while working at Divio between 2014-2021. I still agree with most of it, though there are several aspects that I now think I got wrong."
msgstr ""

#: ../../colophon.rst:29
#: 98186b70905e40df89df10acd814e071
msgid "The original context for the Diátaxis approach was limited to software product documentation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../colophon.rst:31
#: 14cbd0df60874b8c95f1d72ff8a0c331
msgid "In 2021 I was awarded a Fellowship of the `Software Sustainability Institute <http://software.ac.uk/blog/sorry-state-usable-software-open-science-results-open-science-retreat>`_, to explore its application in scientific research contexts. More recently I've explored its application in internal corporate documentation, organisational management and education, and also its application at scale. This work is on-going."
msgstr ""

#: ../../colophon.rst:33
#: 385415cf1c174284a9e0b2bb2e694b40
msgid "Other people have corresponded with me to share their experience of applying Diátaxis to note-taking systems and even as part of a systematic approach to household management."
msgstr ""

